Protein public Sobol direction numbers
=====================================

tools/metal/joe-kuo/new-joe-kuo-6.20000 is an exact publisher-text excerpt for
the first 20,000 dimensions of Joe--Kuo new-joe-kuo-6.21201, and
src/metal/protein_sobol_public.bin contains its compact construction
parameters. Source: https://web.maths.unsw.edu.au/~fkuo/sobol/ (also from
https://github.com/joe-kuo/sobol_data). The generator expands the parameters
with the standard Sobol recurrence; this fork adds fixed-seed SplitMix64
digital shifts. No cuRAND-exported direction or scramble table is bundled.

